WEBVTT

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:04.400
Strike!

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.310
Strike!

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:06.700
Strike!

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.040
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:12.180
Today, we'll meet a strong-armed baseball girl!

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:15.610
It will be Amu-chan's first 
time playing baseball! We're so very excited!

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:18.030
And she'll get more of 
Kukai's special training, too.

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:20.980
Let's blast this ball 
straight down the middle! {a bit non-literal}{I wanted to put "straight over the plate" but that's probably even farrrrrrrrrrther from literal}

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:22.060
Doki!

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:49.360
I'm gonna tell you a secret.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:52.270
Don't tell <i>anyone</i>, okay?

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:55.160
Even though I'm not girly at all,

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:57.930
two certain boys said they like me!

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.870
Jump up a bit into the sky.

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:03.750
My dearest friends are always there.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:06.580
Even if you suddenly Character Change,

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:09.490
I'll be there to stop you with my great big heart.

00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:12.360
Pinky swear!

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:14.760
Cross my heart!

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:17.970
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:21.020
That'd be universal peace, but...

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:23.770
I'll end up protectin' everyone's hearts.

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:26.540
Let's all smile together!

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:29.400
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:32.210
That's world peace! Yeah, that!

00:01:32.510 --> 00:01:35.440
Everyone has dreams, so I'm gonna protect 'em!

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:38.260
Make a victory sign together!

00:01:57.240 --> 00:01:58.550
So, Lulu...

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:04.130
You think Easter's gonna make 
Ikuto do their dirty work tonight?

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:06.840
Even if they do, he's bound to fail.

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:08.620
Let them try.

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:11.780
Anyway, if we don't find the Embryo soon...

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:16.810
She's practicin' this late?

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:19.280
That some pluck she's got there.

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:21.760
We've gotta buck up and try hard ourselves.

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:23.130
True.

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:25.210
I'm coming for you, Embryo!

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:30.420
This time for sure... I'll become a pitcher!

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:35.880
Episode 82
Fierce Battle! I'll become the Ace Player!

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:42.090
Ah, what great weather.

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:43.820
Sure is.

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:46.730
Feels so nice and warm and cozy...

00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:48.350
Watch out!

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:57.760
You okay?

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:00.540
Hinamori-san?

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:03.010
Nishino-san from Class C?

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:07.750
Oh, so you play baseball?

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.410
Yeah. I joined a local team.

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:12.620
Hey, Nishino!

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:13.170
Gotta go.

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:20.640
Wow, you've got a pretty good arm.

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:22.920
Nah, I'm totally average.

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:28.090
Baseball's usually seen as a guy's 
sport, but I guess girls can play, too!

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:30.800
It's a lot of fun. You should give it a go.

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:34.150
Nothin's better than when 
you end up outshinin' the boys.

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:36.400
Yeah? That does sound fun.

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:39.460
Wanna give it a shot?

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:43.320
Wait! How'd I end up here?!

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:47.640
Looks like anyone can participate 
in their practice today.

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:51.690
There are a lot of other kids 
besides you here, Amu-chan.

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:54.670
I've never played baseball 
before, though. What do I do?

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:58.090
Who cares! Do whatever! Enjoy the game!

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:00.550
First base!

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:12.340
Hinamori-san. Don't slack off, 
practice is important.

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:17.820
Wow. I want to try catching the ball.

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:19.820
Finally getting in the spirit, huh?

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:23.020
Hinamori-san!

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:23.490
Got it!

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:26.660
Out!

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:28.120
Nice catch!

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:36.290
Man, I'm so nervous.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:38.870
This is the first 
time I've ever batted.

00:04:38.870 --> 00:04:40.160
And you know...

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:43.180
He's freaky!

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:44.620
I can sense his aura.

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:46.850
He seems quite strong.

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:52.600
Strike!

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.270
I wasn't even close.

00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:59.150
That jerk Fujita's hardcore.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:02.170
Hinamori-san! Keep your eye on the ball!

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:03.990
Easier said than done...

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:09.220
Strike! Batter out!

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:11.140
I couldn't even see it...

00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:14.540
What a total failure...

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:17.820
Fujita's such a jerk! How dare he go 
all-out against a rookie!

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:19.370
That's so not cute.

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:21.430
Who's Fujita? The pitcher?

00:05:21.430 --> 00:05:23.970
Right. And my rival, at that.

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:25.090
Rival?

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:29.190
You mean, you want to be 
a pitcher, Nishino-san?

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:29.850
Yeah.

00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:32.410
Oh? Even though you're a girl?

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:34.200
That's awesome!

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:38.320
I wanna stand right out there on the 
front lines and give my all for the team! {literally: I want to fight eagerly standing in the front of the line}

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:40.480
And that's exactly what the pitcher does.

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:46.750
Oh, now that you mention it... 
How are the positions decided?

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:49.210
The manager picks them before each game.

00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:51.890
But the pitcher's chosen through a test.

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:54.140
It's only one week until that test.

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:56.190
And this time, I'm gonna be the pitcher!

00:05:56.860 --> 00:05:59.190
I'll be cheering for you! You can do it!

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:00.270
Thanks, I will!

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:06.870
Wow, this looks great!

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:08.430
Thanks for the food!

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:13.430
I feel totally re-energized.

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:26.890
And that's why you'll never become a pitcher.

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:29.570
What? That's some big talk for taking a little fried chicken.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:32.420
Yeah! Where do you get off?

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:37.220
You're just scared of your 
position getting stolen.

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:41.040
Like I'd ever lose to the "Wild Thing." {a bit of a rewrite. His nickname for her is literally the "10,000 years no control," "Wild Thing" is a real nickname of the pitcher the movie "Major League" was based on, so...}

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:42.920
What did you call me?!

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:45.550
Um... guys?

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:47.840
They're at it again.

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:49.780
Natsuko-chan, you go girl! {rofl}

00:06:49.780 --> 00:06:51.340
Kick her butt, Fujita-kun!

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:54.400
That's enough.

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:56.850
You two're always at each other's throats.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:59.700
Gotta wonder...

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:01.700
Is this normal for them?

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:04.460
As long as they're having fun, right?

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:11.660
Oh, you're not going home?

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:13.990
Nope. Gonna stay and practice a bit more.

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:21.000
She even practices by herself!

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.260
She certainly is a determined girl, isn't she?

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:27.210
Go, go, Natsuko-chan!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:31.430
I wonder if there's anything
 I can do to help.

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:34.100
I've got it!

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:35.300
Special training?

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:39.970
Right! I wanna help you become 
a pitcher, Nishino-san.

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:41.630
Let's do some special training!

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:42.540
Sure.

00:07:43.840 --> 00:07:45.840
The next day!

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:49.360
So Amu-chan, what did you 
mean by "special training?"

00:07:50.810 --> 00:07:52.670
You had no plan?!

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:55.400
Honestly, you're such a sucker.

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:58.450
Special training, right? 
Special training, hmm...

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:02.850
I know! Why don't we ask <i>him?</i>

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:05.420
Sup.

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:08.380
The former Jack's Chair, Soma-senpai?

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:12.330
He came here today to 
be your special coach!

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:14.340
Yup, heard all about it. Let's do this!

00:08:14.690 --> 00:08:15.720
Right!

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:17.350
Thank you very much!

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:20.850
Okay, now throw it!

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:27.610
Whenever you're ready!

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:30.330
Right!

00:08:33.470 --> 00:08:35.400
She's taking a while to pitch, isn't she?

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:37.370
Do you suppose something's wrong?

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:42.460
All right, I can do it.

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:53.030
Close call.

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:56.410
No sweat. Try again.

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:57.430
Right!

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:07.700
She's got the speed, but no control.

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:10.450
The ball's going all over the place.

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:13.860
Okay, that's enough.

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:21.870
Nishino-san, what's wrong? 
You were doing fine yesterday.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:24.790
I'm sorry, Hinamori-san.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:29.720
Whenever I face a batter, I get all
 nervous and I can't throw right.

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:31.400
So that's it.

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:32.980
Poor Natsuko-chan...

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:37.420
We've gotta teach 
you to conquer your nerves,

00:09:37.420 --> 00:09:40.080
but the way your lower body shakes bothers me too.

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:41.840
My lower body?

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:46.690
Right. If you can't stabilize your lower body, 
you'll never have proper control.

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:49.940
And when you don't have control, 
you get even more nervous.

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:53.450
Okay, let's do it!

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:56.030
Special training!

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:57.700
You wanna be a pitcher, right?

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:00.190
Yeah!

00:10:00.190 --> 00:10:03.700
All right then, it's time for sprints!

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:04.490
Okay!

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:05.790
Comin', Hinamori?

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:13.270
There they went...

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:15.630
Why did we come here? {good question}{rofl, stupid baseball}

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:21.600
Let the special training begin!

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:23.090
Yeah!

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:25.020
Why the heck am I here, too?!

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:26.950
Hey now, don't fall behind!

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:27.730
I won't!

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:29.020
W-Wait, guys...

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:50.710
Yummy!

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:06.050
Last day of special training!

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:08.060
Okay, bring it!

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:19.630
Take this!

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:25.530
She's totally different from when she started.

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:29.960
Pretty good, eh?

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:34.270
Thanks a million!

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:36.740
You've given me so much confidence!

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:37.970
All right!

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:39.750
Thank you, too, Amu-chan!

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:41.870
A-Amu-<i>chan? {I added italics to help emphasize why she is so astonished (I hope)} {first time she calls her by her first name. Actually pretty rare for character of the week, but then again they did train for an entire week together}</i>

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:45.140
Good luck on the test, Natsuko-chan!

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:47.550
Thanks!

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:02.210
Okay. We'll now begin the pitcher test.

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:04.050
Fujita's up first.

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:06.280
Okay! Thank you for this chance!

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:13.400
It's finally here.

00:12:13.860 --> 00:12:16.100
I'm really nervous for some reason.

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:18.460
Why would <i>you</i> be nervous?

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:25.280
Dude, that was a sweet pitch.

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:27.550
Yeah. And his form's good, too.

00:12:27.860 --> 00:12:31.560
Damn you, Fujita... I hate to 
admit it, but you're good.

00:12:33.550 --> 00:12:35.270
I'm this team's ace. {Stays on screen way too long. I don't know how to fix timing~}

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:43.000
No wonder he's the ace. 
He's throwing all strikes.

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:47.200
But Natsuko-chan won't lose to him. 
She's been practicing hard every day!

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:49.430
That's right! She won't lose!

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:51.500
Yup.

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:55.770
Okay, that's enough, Fujita.

00:12:55.770 --> 00:12:56.990
Next, Nishino.

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:00.430
Right! Thank you for letting me try out! {Comes on early and lingers too long}

00:13:04.940 --> 00:13:08.220
Go! Go! Natsuko-chan!

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:09.480
Put your soul in that ball! {lit: "put one's heart and soul into a single ball"}

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:10.600
Desu!

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.840
Natsuko-chan, you can do it!

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:15.060
Stay calm, and throw!

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:28.010
You never change, do you?

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:31.470
This ain't good. She's getting nervous again.

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:33.890
Her body's not staying stable at all.

00:13:33.890 --> 00:13:34.910
Natsuko-chan!

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:37.980
Amu-chan...

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:40.580
It'll be okay! Just calm down!

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.500
Believe in yourself!

00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:51.530
It's not over yet!

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:58.480
She did it! A strike!

00:13:59.180 --> 00:14:00.590
She...

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:05.280
Believe in myself...

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:11.700
That's it!

00:14:17.860 --> 00:14:19.630
Time for the results!

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:21.390
How exciting!

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:23.840
The pitcher for next week's game will be...

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:26.460
Fujita.

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:27.610
You're in.

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:28.560
Right!

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:31.190
But...

00:14:31.190 --> 00:14:32.940
Natsuko-chan...

00:14:32.940 --> 00:14:34.100
Nishino.

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:37.680
You sure have improved, I'm surprised.

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:41.610
But I think you need a bit more control 
before we put you in a game.

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:45.550
Be sure to back Fujita up in the next 
game with some good fielding, okay?

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:48.520
It takes more than just 
a pitcher to win, right?

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:50.310
I will.

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:56.660
I really thought I had it this time...

00:14:57.810 --> 00:14:59.100
Nishino!

00:15:02.940 --> 00:15:04.960
What's the matter with her?

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:08.740
Nishino, that's enough for today. Go home and get some rest!

00:15:08.740 --> 00:15:10.810
Right... Sorry...

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:17.730
Natsuko-chan, um...

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:20.740
Natsuko-chan!

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:23.660
Hinamori, give her some time.

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:24.980
Why?

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:27.480
There's no room for sympathy 
in the world of sports.

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:30.570
At times like this, you've 
gotta pick yourself up.

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:33.480
But... I can't leave her like that!

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:34.620
Sheesh...

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:36.200
Let's go, Kukai!

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.330
Okay.

00:15:43.390 --> 00:15:47.010
I can't be a pitcher and I can't 
concentrate at practice...

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:48.950
What am I doing here?

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:56.520
How long should I keep trying?

00:15:57.480 --> 00:16:00.270
If I stop now, I'll have to abandon 
my dream of being a pitcher...

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:06.070
That's the girl from before.

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:12.220
She's darn lost now, she is. And right after she was all fired up, too.

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:13.220
Lulu!

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:17.440
Yes. I can sense her incredible power.

00:16:21.760 --> 00:16:24.110
I wonder where Natsuko-chan went...

00:16:24.110 --> 00:16:25.930
How worrisome.

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:28.200
I can sense a ? Egg!

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:29.530
It couldn't be...

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:38.140
Your attention, please! Taking the mound is 
 super ace Nishino Natsuko!

00:16:45.800 --> 00:16:48.360
Get a move on! Get goin'!

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:54.350
Character Transformation: Pitching Dream!

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:59.830
I bet none of you can hit this ball!

00:17:01.220 --> 00:17:02.330
What?!

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:05.000
Hey, what the... My body's moving on its own!

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:16.000
Nobody can hit my pitch.

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:18.860
Yep, this is definitely what 
it's like to be a super ace!

00:17:21.730 --> 00:17:23.440
She Character Transformed!

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:25.250
Kukai, we should, too.

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:25.940
Right!

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:30.940
My heart:

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:32.780
Unlock!

00:17:52.410 --> 00:17:54.880
Character Transformation: Sky Jack!

00:17:56.790 --> 00:17:59.400
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:08.400
Amu-chan, Senpai, look at me!

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:10.590
I'm a pitcher now!

00:18:10.590 --> 00:18:14.070
Is this the kind of 
pitcher you wanted to be?

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:17.830
Of course! No one can hit my pitches.

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:19.920
I'm the perfect pitcher!

00:18:19.920 --> 00:18:23.830
I'll show you how strong I am!

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:36.290
You can't escape.

00:18:36.290 --> 00:18:38.260
I have perfect control!

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:41.620
Kukai!

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:43.060
Natsuko-chan, stop this!

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:46.860
What for? I'm finally a pitcher!

00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:48.970
Here, enjoy this a bit more!

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:52.260
Amu-chan, hit it back!

00:18:52.260 --> 00:18:53.330
Okay!

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:59.390
Amu-chan, just keep your eye on the ball.

00:18:59.390 --> 00:19:00.680
Right.

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:04.040
If you think you can hit it, 
go ahead and swing!

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:12.580
It's inside! Hinamori, one step back!

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:17.670
She hit it!

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:18.590
Say what?!

00:19:21.770 --> 00:19:24.640
Go!

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:28.390
Sweet!

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:32.220
A comeback home run, I guess...

00:19:32.220 --> 00:19:34.440
She socked that one into orbit...

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:36.360
Nice job, actually...

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:44.800
If you can hit it like that, maybe I'm not 
cut out to be a pitcher...

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:46.420
That's not true!

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:50.150
You've never given up; you've 
always tried your best!

00:19:50.150 --> 00:19:53.260
And you gained confidence from 
all that training, right?

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:55.960
Yeah! Your drive was really something!

00:19:56.770 --> 00:19:59.010
You can still work at it, Natsuko-chan!

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:02.430
If you practice more, you'll get even better!

00:20:02.960 --> 00:20:05.350
So don't you ever give up, okay?

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:07.330
Don't give up...

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:09.570
I...

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:17.150
Negative heart: Lock on!

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:23.210
Open heart!

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:52.170
Amu-chan? Senpai?

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:54.300
Was that all a dream?

00:20:55.340 --> 00:20:57.000
I've gotta get to practice!

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:02.890
Amu-chan, Senpai, come watch the game.

00:21:02.890 --> 00:21:06.910
I might not be pitching this time, 
but I'll still be playing my best.

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:09.560
Sure, we'll definitely be there.

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:11.020
Great!

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:15.290
And then, it was game day!

00:21:15.630 --> 00:21:18.290
Before we knew it, it was the final 
inning with a score of 1 to 0.

00:21:18.550 --> 00:21:22.510
If they can keep them from scoring, Natsuko's team will win!

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:27.010
Just one more out...

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:30.890
You think you can hit off me?!

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:42.690
We'll never give up!

00:21:51.010 --> 00:21:52.790
Out!

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:54.370
Game over!

00:22:00.450 --> 00:22:01.680
Natsuko-chan!

00:22:01.680 --> 00:22:02.910
She did it!

00:22:02.910 --> 00:22:04.130
Yay!

00:22:04.130 --> 00:22:06.880
Man, that girl's really something.

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:15.410
I'll never let go of my 
dream of becoming a pitcher!

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:36.260
Maybe I was wrong to pretend not to notice your worries.

00:22:36.260 --> 00:22:41.070
It's okay if you can't tell me everything.

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:43.450
With that dark look on your face,

00:22:43.450 --> 00:22:45.690
go ahead and scream dark things.

00:22:45.690 --> 00:22:50.000
You shouldn't leave all those heavy feelings inside.

00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:51.480
Ride On!

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:57.680
If you don't... If it's like that...

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:00.600
You couldn't tell me if you wanted to, huh?

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:04.350
I get it.

00:23:04.350 --> 00:23:07.010
I'm sure your circumstances will change one day.

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:10.040
That time will come! That time is now!

00:23:13.860 --> 00:23:15.670
Don't you want to have someone

00:23:15.670 --> 00:23:18.300
say congratulations to you once in your life?

00:23:18.300 --> 00:23:23.230
Doesn't the breeze feel nice today?

00:23:23.230 --> 00:23:27.600
Even if you feel like it's all you can do to survive...

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:32.470
You can make your life into something you enjoy. It's so nice!

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:37.290
"Everything's for you."

00:23:37.290 --> 00:23:41.890
How about that?

00:23:43.590 --> 00:23:45.040
My boy!

00:23:50.360 --> 00:23:53.670
Amu-chan, everyone's heading 
out next weekend!

00:23:53.670 --> 00:23:56.240
Yep, for the World Music Fair!

00:23:56.240 --> 00:23:59.860
Apparently, it's an event showcasing stuff to 
do with music from all over the world. {Hm, musical instruments maybe? Or is she talking about musicians from all over the world?}

00:23:59.860 --> 00:24:02.290
I will have to make lunches for everyone!

00:24:02.290 --> 00:24:03.720
Don't forget the snacks!

00:24:03.720 --> 00:24:05.180
Huh? What's the matter?

00:24:05.180 --> 00:24:07.340
I've got a funny feeling...

00:24:07.340 --> 00:24:08.140
Yeah!

00:24:08.140 --> 00:24:09.910
That's...

00:24:09.910 --> 00:24:12.150
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.150 --> 00:24:14.170
Chance Encounter at the World Music Fair? {I like Chance Encounter~} {editor: This is literal, but for some reason doesn't sit right with me. I want to say something like "It all happened at the World Music Fair", or something more short story sounding like that... but it's too far from lit, I think maybe...}

00:24:14.170 --> 00:24:15.610
That's got to be...

00:24:15.610 --> 00:24:16.640
Ikuto-nya!

00:24:16.640 --> 00:24:19.560
Ikuto! Where are you, Ikuto-nya?
